  "explicit_limitations": [
    "Headline 44.3% (31/70) is pass@3 across 3 runs on the active 70-target / 12-spec challenge subset, not single-run pass@1 across all 265 targets (195 retired targets in Table A1 are excluded from Table 3 denominators).",
    "Proving Spec => P establishes correctness only of the formalized TLA+ specification (under extracted .cfg assumptions, Ivy-to-TLA+ translations, and recursive-LET rewrites), not that production Go/Rust/C++ code implements the specification without defects.",
    "Soundness remains relative to the trusted computing base (SANY, TLAPS, Z3, Isabelle/TLA+, and LS4), which itself required strict-mode patches and bug fixes during benchmark development.",
    "Evaluation in Table 3 covers only four GPT models running inside Codex; Cahill SSI, MongoDB transactions, Wildfire refinement, and Ivy TLB NonStarvation liveness remain at 0% across all 12 configurations."
  ],
